---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="py-14 md:py-20" aria-labelledby="easy-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-6 rounded-[var(--radius-soft)] border border-line bg-white p-6 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:gap-8 md:p-10" data-reveal>
      <span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sage text-river"><Icon name="eye" size={30} /></span>
      <div>
        <h2 id="easy-heading" class="text-[clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem+1vw,2rem)]">Made to be easy on the eyes.</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[46rem]">
          The letters on this site are set in Atkinson Hyperlegible, a typeface the Braille Institute designed for readers with low vision. Every letter is shaped so it is hard to mistake for another. Need it bigger? Use the <strong>Text size</strong> buttons at the top of the page. The site remembers your choice.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
